text:
{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 120 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E12", "D4"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Fondaparinux sodium is not on FDA's drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label for NDC 11797015609 identifies Italfarmaco S.p.A. as the labeler and lists two registered plants: Italfarmaco S.p.A. (FEI 1196) and ScinoPharm Taiwan, Ltd. (FEI 3002840477).",
      "cites": ["E8", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1326554 of ScinoPharm Taiwan, Ltd. ended on 2026-06-23 and was classified OAI; FDA's known date for that classification is 2026-09-21.",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The OAI classification was posted 120 days before the current as-of date of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E12", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Italfarmaco S.p.A.'s most recent inspection (1250897) ended 2023-06-28 and was classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 6.6 days of supply on hand; Corvale General has 30.6 days and can spare 79 syringes while retaining two weeks of inventory.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based recommendation is to transfer 79 syringes of 7.5 mg/0.6 mL from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would bring Corvale East to 14 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    }
  ]
}
